  "空白为全部": "blank for all",
  "由本机Python读取你在Excel中准备好的PI结果，并自动追加到当前账号。读取前可刷新Excel公式；同名指标沿用已有公式，实时分组和日均汇总分开存放。": "Local Python reads the PI results prepared in Excel and appends them to your account. It can refresh formulas first, reuse existing metric formulas, and keep live readings separate from daily means.",
  "先运行Python启动器，再点击连接。读取范围和列映射在本机同步窗口设置，预览确认后开始。": "Run the Python launcher, then connect. Set the range and column mapping in the local sync window, preview and confirm.",
  "首次使用：先下载 Windows 便携启动器，完整解压后双击 ProcessEngineerWorkbench.exe（无需安装 Python）。保留启动窗口，再点击“打开本机文档检索”。": "First use: download and fully extract the Windows portable launcher, then run ProcessEngineerWorkbench.exe. Python is included. Keep the launcher open and choose Open local document search.",
  "若无法打开，请先确认启动器已运行且没有报错；也可以直接使用启动器自动打开的检索页面。旧版启动器需要更新。": "If it does not open, check that the launcher is running without errors. You can also use the search page it opens automatically. Update older launchers.",
  "网页的数据分析可继续在这里使用。只检索文档不需要迁移生产数据；网站与本机页面的数据存储彼此独立。": "Continue data analysis here. Document search does not require transferring process data. Website and local-page storage are separate.",
  "文档内容和检索索引保留在本机，不会发送到网站，也不包含在工作台 JSON 备份中。其他人需要自己的原始文档及访问权限。": "Documents and search indexes stay on this computer. They are not uploaded or included in workbench JSON backups. Other users need their own documents and access rights.",
  "便携版已包含 Python 和 pywin32，使用者无需另行安装。电脑仍需 Windows、桌面版 Microsoft Office 和文档权限。此按钮不会自动安装或启动软件。": "The portable app includes Python and pywin32. Windows, desktop Microsoft Office and document permissions are required. Downloading does not install or launch the app.",
  "读取已打开Excel默认先强制重算NOW和DataLink公式，也可调用本工作簿的刷新宏；文件模式仅读取已保存结果。刷新失败不写入，实际PI刷新效果请首次与手动Update核对。Python已加入白名单时优先运行Python脚本版，打包EXE的权限需单独确认。": "Reading an open Excel workbook first recalculates NOW and DataLink formulas; a workbook refresh macro is also supported. File mode reads saved results only. Failed refreshes are not imported. Initially compare PI results with manual Update. Use Python scripts when python.exe is allowlisted; EXE permissions are separate.",
  "相同采样时间、分组和指标的有效新值会更新旧值，其他历史保留。空值、Excel错误值不覆盖已有有效数据。支持同时连接多个装置或分组，每组在独立本机窗口预览后启动。Python在后台排队刷新；网页刷新后可恢复仍打开的同步窗口。请保留工作台、同步窗口和本机服务；关闭同步窗口、停止或退出账号后停止。": "Valid new readings replace the same timestamp, group and metric; other history is retained. Blank or error cells do not overwrite valid data. Multiple units or groups can sync from separate local preview windows. Python queues refreshes in the background. Reloading the website can reconnect open sync windows. Keep the workbench, sync windows and local service open; closing a window, stopping or signing out ends sync.",
  "填写新分组名可新建日均汇总表，也可选择已有每天一行的历史分组（未分组可留空）。按北京时间自然日，对Excel有效采样均值取算术平均；重复刷新不重复计数。当天为暂存日均，缺测不补零；仅有部分时段时也只代表已读取时段。计算指标使用同一公式基于日均输入重算。": "Enter a new daily-summary group or select an existing group with one row per day. Daily means use valid Excel samples grouped by UTC+8 calendar date. Refreshes do not duplicate samples. Today is provisional; missing readings are not zero-filled. Partial-day data represents only the sampled period. Calculated metrics are recomputed from daily inputs.",
  "最近366行；完整历史保存在数据中心所选分组，随工作台保存和备份。采样点数不代表全天完整率。": "Latest 366 rows. Full history is in the selected Data center group and included in saves. Sample counts do not indicate full-day coverage.",
